                <pb facs="0685" n="613" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg613"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5082/106.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Special Commissioner Buchanan to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Willemstadt</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-02-11"><hi rendition="#italic">February 11,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Buchanan reports the settlement of entire Bermudez case, which has been
                    accepted by Bartlett and ratified by cabinet. Adds that protocol has been
                    equally ratified and that he is leaving for United States.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
